l, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 734761, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DZfoUNWXvtNk1gWsJhY3Tq", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 737046, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KwqNPVsQsNnGHX4qropVae", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 requires banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). This caused the nightly build failure in `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even`.\n\n## Change\n- Switch the rounding mode from `ROUND_HALF_UP` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in `src/money.py`.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0002` on commit `0a9452f727` (branch updated with latest main): passed.\n- Expected results: `2.675` \u2192 `2.68`, `2.665` \u2192 `2.66`.\n\nNote: this changes rounding for exact-half cases (e.g., `2.665` now rounds to `2.66` instead of `2.67`). Reviewers should confirm this matches FIN-212 for all callers.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-pr-0a9452f727"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 737946, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KwqNPVsQsNnGHX4qropVae", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-pr-0a9452f727", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 737946, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KwqNPVsQsNnGHX4qropVae", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 739785, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main, with alex requested as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Fix:** In `src/money.py`, `round_money` now uses `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` instead of `ROUND_HALF_UP`, matching FIN-212 and the test expectations (2.675 \u2192 2.68, 2.665 \u2192 2.66).\n- **CI:** The first run (`ci-0001`) passed on commit `08d3cd5986`. The PR was then rejected because the branch was behind main, so I merged main into the branch (`0a9452f727`). I re-ran CI (`ci-0002`) on that commit and it passed.\n- **Not done:** I did not merge. Merging into main needs code-owner approval.\n\nThe PR description notes that exact-half cases now round differently for any caller that relied on half-up. Alex should confirm that matches FIN-212 for all callers.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01KxNuWpCP8z2bDqZdJuuv5d", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01D2RkXAFnRtmwjxomaJbSwz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TvTv8LD2AZmRCo6BKyop7Q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The test expectations match half-even (2.675 \u2192 2.68, 2.665 \u2192 2.66). I'll create a branch and make that change.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PWz8pv3ezKbmTvXvASNpjc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FrumfZwgg3iEDi4gisRGwF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money was using ROUND_HALF_UP, contrary to the banker's rounding\nrequirement in FIN-212 and the expectations in tests/test_money.py.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01A9RdVYxLcyiTGRR5uJQPUu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-fix-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RWDkDV5XLvMXMnEJXPsDqi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed. Opening the pull request now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Jk8ddjGdzaYKeB3dMJ7W4a", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 requires banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). This caused the nightly build failure in `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even`.\n\n## Change\n- Switch the rounding mode from `ROUND_HALF_UP` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in `src/money.py`.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Expected results: `2.675` \u2192 `2.68`, `2.665` \u2192 `2.66`.\n\nNote: this changes rounding for exact-half cases (e.g., `2.665` now rounds to `2.66` i